	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `pr &lt;text&gt;` to open PR references found in the text, e.g. `pr api#123`.
With no text, the clipboard is parsed instead.
⌘↩ copies the PR URL instead of opening it. Set a hotkey on the Hotkey trigger to open references in the current selection.

Supported: `repo#123` (uses default_org), `org/repo#123`, and github.com PR/issue URLs.</string>
